# ONE HAND touch layout check (not a store asset): the resting ring with
# the SECONDARY / BOOST / TELEPORT action arc on its far side. Render with
# NEWTONIA_FORCE_TOUCH=1 at phone sizes (shots/mobile.sh onehand, or
# NEWTONIA_SHOT_SIZE) in both orientations; swap the handedness word to
# see the tilted arcs. The secondary circle needs a secondary equipped —
# the mine pickup under the ship is collected during the sim window, once
# the tap has dismissed the first-game TOUCH CONTROLS help card.
game 1
sim 1500
tap 0.5 0.5 200
camera fixed
ship 0 0 0
pickup mine 0 0
asteroid 700 400 tough
asteroid -800 300 armoured
asteroid 300 -800
one_hand centre
